  "description_en": "Reviews store photos based on storefront scene recognition and multimodal large model element localization. It outputs storefront scene classifications and confidence details, and localizes storefronts, signboards, entrances, and business signs. It is applicable to store data collection, storefront photo classification, and inspection reviews",
